      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, i thought you said you'd be an academic professor? that goblin analogy is a bit weird lol. can we just stick to the physics part? can you explain the \"spooky action at a distance\" thing specifically? why did einstein call it that? i need to understand the actual mechanism for my exam.",
