      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay that makes more sense. so if the wave function collapses instantly, how do physicists actually prove it's not just some hidden variable we haven't found yet? like, how do we know there isn't some \"secret\" set of instructions inside the particles from the start?",
      "source": "evaluator"
